ource_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544501","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"迪尔格雷和杜瑞拉及时赶到了考试现场，试图平息事态。但周...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1610544502:1":{"key":"say:4:1610544502:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544502","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"佐尔娅老师并没有急着和你接触，而是走到一边开始维持秩序...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1610544503:2":{"key":"say:7:1610544503:2","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544503","action_index":"2","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你从远处看到，迪尔格雷瞥向校长倒下的方向，意味深长地摇...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1610544504:1":{"key":"say:8:1610544504:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544504","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"各位，如你们所见，现场出现了严重事故。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1610544505:1":{"key":"say:9:1610544505:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544505","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"此事十分重大，我会通报王室相关人员。至于学校内部的事务……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1610544506:1":{"key":"say:11:1610544506:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544506","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"注意，为了查明事故原因，现场所有人未经允许，暂时不得离开！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1610544507:1":{"key":"say:13:1610544507:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544507","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"杜瑞拉，这不妥当！校长的情况尚未公开，现场不适合聚集这...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1610544508:1":{"key":"say:14:1610544508:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544508","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"让他们先回校舍休息，之后再挨个询问是更好的做法。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1610544509:1":{"key":"say:15:1610544509:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1610544509","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不，事关校长，不能放跑任何一个可